Model Platform_decom
Title: PLATFORM
Description: This PLATFORM Decision Tool is a multi-attribute decision framework to enable decision makers and stakeholders to explore and choose decision options for decommissioning oil & gas platforms. The framework applies decision analysis to formulate objectives as a set of attributes, the criteria that stakeholder care about.  It applies these objectives to  to quantify the desirability of these options to stakeholders with varying perspectives. It organizes the decision options into a hierarchy, identifying the main decision options at the top, with variations of each decision at lower levels. It allows the decision maker to make decisions about how to decommission platforms individually or as a group.
Author: Max Henrion & Surya Swamy, Lumina Decision Systems. Inc
Date: Mon, May 11, 2009 11:53 AM
SaveAuthor: Lumina
SaveDate: Mon, Apr 30, 2018 1:02 PM
DefaultSize: 48,24
DiagState: 2,0,2,867,500,17,,2
WindState: 2,525,313,708,396
FontStyle: Arial, 15
