Variable Equipment_list
Title: Equipment List
Description: Equipment spread roughly based on MMS_EIT_ch6_barge_spreads.pdf, Table 6.1.2-2		~
1. DB50 Heavy Lifting Barge: Data form J. Ray McDermott for DB50~
2. Anchor Handling Tug: Based on vessel similar to Blizzrd (ITC - International Transport Contractors)~
3. Support Vessel :Based on vessel similar to Sea Lion (Global Industries Ltd.)~
4. Tugboats: Based on vessel similar to Patriot Service (Hornbecj Offshore Services)~

