Variable Emission_factors
Title: Emission Factors
Units: g/kW-hr
Description: (1) Emissions factors (except SOx) and BSFC from USEPA Current Methodologies in Preparing Mobile Source Port-Related Emission Inventories - Final Report April 2009.  See Tables  2-9 for Main Engines and 2-16 for Aux Engines.								~
(2) Assume use CARB Ultra Low Sulfur Diesel (7.05 lb/gal and 15 ppmw S) in all engines.  Calculate SOx as SO2.							~

