Variable Emissions
Title: Emissions
Units: Tons
Definition: IF Equipment_type = 'DB50 Heavy Lifting Barge' THEN~
Total_kw*Emission_factors*Duty_cycle[Air_quality_platform='DB50']*Operating_hours_per_*Operating_days_for_p*(1/453.6)*(1/2000)~
ELSE Total_kw*Emission_factors*Duty_cycle[Air_quality_platform='Other']*Operating_hours_per_*Operating_days_for_p*(1/453.6)*(1/2000)
