Variable Air_quality_impact_f
Title: Air quality impact factor
Description: Air emissions from the decommissioning operation are roughly correlated with the level of effort and the time on station of large equipment and the size of the HLV selected.~
The impact factor is defined as the product of the number of service days the HLVs have to be on-site for both complete and partial and the size of the HLV selected for the project
Definition: Service_days_by_remo*hlv_size
NodeLocation: 96,144,1
NodeSize: 48,31
WindState: 2,102,90,840,307
ValueState: 2,487,441,987,563,0,MIDM
ReformVal: [Hlv_size,Platform]
Att_ResultSliceState: [Platform_da_for_hlv_,1,Platform,1,Hlv_size,2]

Index Air_quality_threshol
Title: Air quality thresholds
Definition: Var Max := Max(Air_quality_impact_f[HLV_size=4000,Platform_da_for_hlv_='1 Complete platform removal'],Platform);~
sequence(0,Max,Max/4)~

NodeLocation: 224,40,1
NodeSize: 48,24
WindState: 2,34,48,698,226
ValueState: 2,512,76,385,235,0,MIDM
ReformVal: [Hlv_size,Platform_da_for_hlv_]
NumberFormat: 2,D,2,2,0,0,2,1,$,0,"ABBREV",0
Att_PrevIndexValue: [0,113K,226K,339K,452K]

Variable Attribute_level_by_t
Title: Attribute level by threshold
Description: The threshold represents a five-point (best-worst)  scale of the impact factors which are then used to generate the air quality attribute levels.
Definition: Table(Air_quality_threshol)('Best','Good ','Medium','Poor','Worst')
NodeLocation: 216,144,1
NodeSize: 48,31
WindState: 2,102,90,556,199
DefnState: 2,234,33,416,303,0,MIDM
ValueState: 2,1481,44,201,199,0,MIDM
Aliases: FormNode Attribute_level_by_1
NumberFormat: 2,I,4,2,0,0,4,0,$,0,"ABBREV",0

Variable Air_quality_attribu3
Title: Air quality attribute levels by platforms considered
Description: Air emissions from the decommissioning operation are roughly correlated with the level of effort and the time on station of large equipment and the size of the HLV selected. The impact factors, defined as the product of the number of service days the HLVs have to be on-site for both complete and partial and the size of the HLV selected for the project, are used to compute air quality thresholds using the Best-Worst Attribute levels defined for the MAUA.
Definition: var result := Air_quality_attribu1[Platform=Platforms_to_conside,Platform_da_for_hlv_=Selected_options_by_,hlv_size=Max_HLV_size_require];~
IF result = Null THEN 'No Action' else result
NodeLocation: 296,240,1
NodeSize: 80,28
WindState: 2,102,90,818,224
ValueState: 2,904,482,560,587,0,MIDM
Aliases: FormNode Air_quality_attribut
ReformVal: [Selected_scenarios,Platforms_to_conside]

