Variable Mean_biomass_by_str1
Title: Mean biomass by strata, species, platform
Units: grams/m2
Description: Converts biomass model data from 2D input table to a multidimensional table by platform, species, and strata.
Definition: Index cols:= ['Platform','Strata','Species','Mean (g/m2)'];~
VAR x :=  MdTable(Input_biomass_estim[Biomass_fields=cols],Biomass_records,cols,['Biomass_platforms','Strata','Species'],,conglomerationFn:"average");~
VAR result := x;~
IF IsNumber(result) THEN result ELSE 0
