Variable Shell_mound_dredgin1
Title: Shell mound dredging impacts
Description: Under complete removal, if shell mounds are removed, then benthic attribute level is 'Worst'.. If shell mounds are not removed  then the attribute level is 'Medium'; partial removal results in an 'Medium' attribute level due to chance of minor toxicity of shell mounds
Definition: VAR result := (IF Remove_shell_mounds_ = 1 THEN 'Worst' ELSE 'Medium' );~
IF Result = «null» THEN 'Average' ELSE result~

