Variable Anchoring_impacts
Title: Anchoring Impacts
Description: Due to anchoring impacts, the benthic impacts attribute level for complete removal is 'Worst' for  deeper platforms and 'Poor' for shallow platforms. If partial removal is selected, then the attribute level is 'Medium'.
Definition: IF Selected_options_by_ = 'No action' THEN 'No action' ELSE~
IF Selected_options_by_ = '2 Partial platform removal' THEN 'Medium'~
ELSE IF Selected_options_by_ = '1 Complete platform removal' AND Selected_platforms_d = 'Shallow' THEN 'Poor'~
ELSE 'Worst'
