Variable Benthic_impact_attr1
Title: Benthic Impact Attribute level by platforms considered
Description: In general, attribute level is 'Worst' for complete removal. Platforms with shallow depth have rank 'Poor', while deeper platforms put the attribute level at 'Worst'. Partial removal has lower impact potential. If shell mound dredging is selected for a platform (under the complete removal scenario), then impact potential is higher. If not, then impact potential is moderate due to the toxicity of shell mounds
Definition: IF Benthic_impacts_rati = 'No action' THEN 'No action' ELSE Attribute_level_by_r[Attribute_score=Benthic_impacts_rati]
