Module Multi_Attrib_DA
Title: Multi Attribute Analysis
Description: Summary of the attributes used in the multiattribute decision analysis. For each attribute, it specifies its ~
 Type: Quantitative or qualitative~
  Best outcome: Brief description of the best outcome for that attribute.~
  Worst outcome: Brief description of the best outcome for that attribute.~
  Swing weight:  The weight of each attribute to quantify the value of swinging from worst to best outcome relative to the attribute with swing weight of 100. ~
~
Usually, you should first idenitfy which attribute is most important -- i.e. change from worst to best outcome has largest effect on desirability of outcome -- and assign 100 to that. Then you can assign a relative swing weight (0 to 100) to each of the other attributes.
