Title: Attribute ratings by level
Description: Numerical rating from 0 to 100 for each attribute level for qualitative attributes.  The default is set to a  linear scale, 0, 25, 50, 75, 100 for Worst, poor, medium, good, best.  Worst and Best must be left at 0 and 100, by definition. But, you can modify the intermediate ratings for each qualitative attribute, provided they retain the ordering Worst < Poor < Medium < Good < Best.
