Variable Equivalent_cost_sens
Title: Equivalent cost sensitivity
Units: $Millions
Description: Displays the sensitivity of the equivalent costs by platform (and scenario) to changes in the input cost weights for each attribute. The fundamental analysis behind a tornado diagram consists of varying only one input variable at a time, keeping all other variables at their nominal values.
