DisplayOutputs: Variable Indented_module_name

Function Submodules(m: Handle)
Title: Submodules(m)
Description: Returns a list of all the submodules (including m) of the module with identifier m, but excluding the module in Excluded_module, usually the name of this module library.
Definition: Metavar res := [m];~
Metavar c := contains of  m ;~
IF IsNull(c) THEN res~
ELSE BEGIN~
  Metavar v[] := c DO BEGIN~
     IF Isamodule( v) AND v<>Excluded_module~
          THEN res := Concat(res, Submodules(v)) ELSE 0;~
  END; ~
  copyindex( res )~
END~

