Decision Outline_tree_on_left
Title: Outline tree on left
Description: By default, ACP shows an expandable outline tree of modules on the left hand side of the window. This makes it easy to navigate around a model with many modules. For small models, and most web apps, you may want to suppress this. You can configure ACP not to show the outline tree by inserting the text show_outline:no into the top model's CloudPlayerStyles attrbute to prevent ACP from displaying the Outline.
Definition: Checkbox(1)
NodeLocation: 112,144,-5
NodeSize: 68,20
WindState: 2,281,101,655,503
NodeColor: 65535,65535,65535
OnChange: Toggle_AWP_flag('show_outline:no',   Hide_outline);~
hide_outline_preview(); /* hides outline image on diagram preview */~
umds();  /* updates Use Model Diagram Size images */~


