Function Toggle_awp_tag(o: Handle; tag: Text; t: Boolean)
Title: Toggle_AWP_tag(o, flag, t)
Description: If t is true then insert tag into AWP_attrib of object o, otherwise remove the tag.~
You can use this function in the Script of a Checkbox Input node to set (or unset) the AWP_attrib according to the value of the Checkbox.
Definition: VAR at :=  AWP_attrib OF o;~
at := IF at = NULL THEN '' ELSE at;~
AWP_attrib OF o :=  IF t THEN at&', '&tag~
ELSE TextReplace(at, ', '&tag, '', All: True)
