Function Clean_newlines(t: Text orNull)
Title: Clean_newlines(t)
Description: Removes any leading or trailing new line, space, or tab characters from text t, and replaces any multiple new lines internal to t with a single new line.
Definition: t := Texttrim(t);~
/*remove double new line characters*/~
Textreplace( t, "\r[\r\n]+",  chr(13), all: True, re: True)
