Decision Auto_calc
Title: Auto calc
Description: When checked, ACP calculates any result (table or graph) immediately when it visible to the user. If the user changes an input that affects the result, it recalculates the result immediately. This behavior is unlike desktop Analytica, which does not usually calculate results until the user asks for them by clicking a Calc button. (It combines Calculate on open and Auto recalc results.)
Definition: Checkbox(0)
