Function shift_x_pos(nodeid: handle, delta :number coerce)
Title: shift_x_pos
Description: Alters a node's nodelocation attribute and thereby it's position horizontally by adding the second parameter to the x-position of the node.
Definition: var nodeloc := splittext(nodelocation of nodeid, ',');~
var newX = evaluate(nodeloc[@nodeloc=1]) + delta;~
nodeloc[@nodeloc=1]:=newX & '';~
nodeloc := join(nodeloc, nodeloc, ',');~
nodelocation of nodeid:= nodeloc
