Function setRestrictNavigatio()
Title: setRestrictNavigation
Definition: /* check or uncheck other other check boxes which depend on this one */~
if (Remove_all_navigatio) then ~
(~
  ~
  toggle_check_box(true, handle(ToolbarTabsCheckbox));~
  toggle_check_box(true, handle(ParentButtonCheckbox));~
 ~
~
  if (not Outline_tree_on_left) then ~
  (   ~
      toggle_check_box(true, handle(Outline_tree_on_left));~
      evaluatescript( script of handle(Outline_tree_on_left)); ~
   );~
);~
~
/* evaluate the script attribute for the other checkboxes */~
evaluatescript( script of handle(ToolbarTabsCheckbox) );~
evaluatescript( script of handle(ParentButtonCheckbox) );~
~

