Function set_y_pos(nodeid: handle, y :number coerce)
Title: set_y_pos
Description: Similar to shift_y_pos, but this is relative to "originNode".  ~
~
1.  When
Definition: /* get yPos originNode */~
var originLoc := splittext(nodelocation of originNode, ',');~
var yOrigin =  evaluate(originLoc[@originLoc=2]) ;~
~
/* update location node passed in relative to originNode */~
var nodeloc := splittext(nodelocation of nodeid, ','); ~
var newY = yOrigin + y;~
nodeloc[@nodeloc=2]:=newY & '';~
nodeloc := join(nodeloc, nodeloc, ',');~
nodelocation of nodeid:= nodeloc
