Function getYPos(nodeid: handle  )
Title: getYPos
Description: This is a model developer helper function.  You can use this function to help figure out what you need to pass to set_y_pos.
Definition: /* get yPos originNode */~
var originLoc := splittext(nodelocation of originNode, ',');~
var yOrigin =  evaluate(originLoc[@originLoc=2]) ;~
~
/* get yPos of nodeid */~
var nodeloc := splittext(nodelocation of nodeid, ','); ~
var yNodeid =  evaluate(nodeloc[@nodeloc=2]) ;~
~
/* return yPos nodeid relative to originNode */~
yNodeid - yOrigin
