Function setUseTopDiagSize(showMsgBox)
Definition: if (Navigation_style = "Tabs down left" or Navigation_style = "Tabs across top") then (~
~
if (showMsgBox=True) then~
/*Display a message that you cannot uncheck this checkbox if Navigation style is Tabs down left or Tabs across top */~
msgbox("When 'Web application' is selected as the '" &(title of Main_style)& "' you must use the top diagram size for all ACP windows.", 0) else null; ~
~
~
 /* when using Top or Side tabs, one must use 'Use top diagram size:yes', also the preview includes the white masking */~
 Definition of Use_top_diagram_size:="checkbox(1)"~
~
)~
else ~
(~
  Toggle_AWP_flag('Use_top_diagram_size:yes', Use_top_diagram_size );~
  umds();~
)~

