Decision Main_style
Title: Main style
Description: Select the Main style for navigating the model in ACP:~
~
Analytica model review: Similar to Analytica on the desktop. ~
•Useful when you want to share the model with someone who knows Analytica. ~
•It can show an expandable Outline of modules on the left or hierarchy headers across the top. ~
~
Web application: Best for deploying the model on the web. ~
•It offers a tabbed navigation familiar for web applications. ~
•Each module in the top model becomes a tab. You can show the tabs across the top or down the left side of the diagram.
Definition: Choice(Main_styles,2,0)
