Decision Navigation_style
Title: Navigation style
Description: For Main style 'Analytica model review', select:~
•Outline on left: Displays an expandable outline of the modules on the left, like desktop Analytica's Outline view.~
•Hierarchy headers: Displays parent/ancestor modules across the top of each diagram, like desktop Analytica's hierarchy view.~
~
For Main style  'Web application', each module in main model becomes a tab (ordered left to right then top to bottom). Select:~
•Tabs across top: Display the tabs left to right across the top of the diagram~
•Tabs down left: Display the tabs in a column on the left of the diagram.
Definition: Choice(Navigation_styles,1,0)
