Decision Table_or_graph_
Title: Table and/or graph
Description: Select whether to show the result of the variable as a table, graph, or both one above the other:~
•As saved in Analytica: Show just table or graph as last viewed in desktop Analytica.~
•Table: Just show as a table.~
•Graph: Just show as a graph~
•Graph above table:~
•Table above graph:~
Note: An Edit table, or a scalar, is always displayed as a table regardless of this setting.
Definition: Choice(table_or_graph_opts,1,0,result:@(table_or_graph_opts))
