Variable Marine_mam_attribute
Title: Marine Mammals Attribute Levels
Description: In the long-term, both removal options have similar impact potential on marine mammals. In the short-term, marine mammals are affected by complete removal, if explosives are used, putting the attribute level at 'Worst' . If no explosives are used, then the attribute level is 'Poor' because of impact potential on movement, migration, or foraging. If partial removal is selected,  attribute level is 'Medium' since there are little or no impacts on movement or migration.
Definition: IF Marine_mammals_ratin = 'No action' THEN 'No action' ELSE Attribute_level_by_r[Attribute_score=Marine_mammals_ratin]
