Variable Bird_attribute_level
Title: Bird Attribute Levels
Description: Attribute levels for complete and partial removal are good since platform removal will likely result in reduced mortality due to elimination of collisions with platforms. Although, there is a chance that loss of offshore roosting locations leads to increased energy requirements and slight reduction in survival and/or fitness. Thus, it is likely that the net attribute level is 'Medium'
