Variable Water_quality_rating
Title: Water quality Rating by Platforms
Description: The Water Quality Attribute has two impact categories - Accident Spills & Discharges and Shell Mound Dredging Impacts. The attribute scores for each of these impacts are combined into one single attribute score for Water Quality by taking the lowest score (worst attribute level) for a given Platform. For e.g. if a platform's score for accidental spills & discharges is 50 (Medium) and 25 (Poor) for shell mound dredging impacts, the net score for water quality is 25 (Poor).
Definition: Min([Attribute_rating_for,Attribute_rating_fo1])~

