Variable Contingency_costs1
Title: Contingency costs
Units: $
Description: General contingency factor of 15% applied against: plat prep+cond removal+structure "contingency portion" of deck & jacket removal+pile removal + site clearance. This covers unanticipated issues except weather delays. Weather contingency is 5% for south coast platforms, 10% for SB channel platforms and 15% for platforms at or north of pt Arguello and is applied to the same cost criteria as described for the general contingency.
Definition: (Weather_contingency+ Misc_contig_costs) [Platform=Platforms_to_conside][Decommissioning_alt6=Selected_options_by_]
NodeLocation: 352,64,1
NodeSize: 64,32
WindState: 2,98,79,905,334
ValueState: 2,500,672,416,303,0,MIDM
ReformVal: [Platforms_to_conside,Selected_scenarios]

Variable Weather_contingency
Title: Weather Contingency Costs
Units: $
Description: Weather contingency =5% South Coast (Edith,Ellen, Elly, Eureka & state Emma, Esther,Eva ),10% SB Channel &15% Pt Arguello & North (Harvest, Hermosa, Hildago & Irene). Factored against plat prep, conductor removal +structure removal contingency portion for deck & jacket + pile removal + site clearance
Definition: var pile_removal_costs := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1="Pile - removal"];~
var dr_contingency := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1="  contingency portion"];~
var jr_contingency := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1=" contingency portion"];~
var conductors_cost := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1="Conductors "];~
var platform_prepcost := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1="Platform Preparation "];~
var siteclearance_cost := Input_decommiss__cos[Decommissioning_cos1="Site Clearance "];~
Weather_contig_pcent*(pile_removal_costs + dr_contingency + jr_contingency + conductors_cost + platform_prepcost + siteclearance_cost)~

