Variable Weather_contig_pcent
Title: Weather Contigency Percent
Units: %
Description: Weather contingency =5% South Coast (Edith,Ellen, Elly, Eureka & state Emma, Esther,Eva ),10% SB Channel &15% Pt Arguello & North (Harvest, Hermosa, Hildago & Irene). Factored against plat prep, conductor removal +structure removal contingency portion for deck & jacket + pile removal + site clearance
