Variable Input_decommiss_csts
Title: Input decommiss. costs by selected platforms
Units: $
Description: Enables model operator to compare the complete platform removal costs to the partial platfor removal costs for each platform
Definition: (IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "HLV Mobilization & Demobilization" THEN  ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '1 Complete platform removal' THEN Mob_demob_cost_compl ELSE  HLV_Mobilization_Cos ~
 ELSE IF  Decommissioning_cos1 = "Abrasive Cut Spread Mob/Demob" THEN Abrasive_cutter_fix1~
 ELSE IF  Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Permitting & Regulatory Compliance' THEN Permitting___complia~
 ELSE IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Proj mgmt & Engr & Planning" THEN Pjmt_engr_plan_costs~
 ELSE IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Shell Mound Removal ' THEN ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '1 Complete platform removal'  THEN Smound_removal_costs[Platform=Platforms_to_conside] ELSE 0~
 ELSE IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Reef Enhancement' THEN ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '2 Partial platform removal'  THEN Reef_enhancement_co1[Platform=Platforms_to_conside] ELSE 0~
ELSE Input_decommiss__cos[Platform=Platforms_to_conside])*Cost_uncertainty
