Variable Part_removl_factors
Title: Partial Removal Factors
Description: a factor that is multiplied by the complete platform removal option cost data to reflect the reduction or increase in costs to reflect partial platform removal
Definition: IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Conductors ' THEN Conductor_par_rem_fa ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Deck - removal" THEN Deck_par_rem_factor ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Pile - removal" THEN Pile_par_rem_factor ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Jacket - removal" THEN Jacket_par_rem_facto ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "  contingency portion"THEN Deck_contingency_pr ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = " contingency portion" THEN Jacket_contingency_p ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Transportation & Disposal (metal)" THEN Trans_disp_strct_prf ELSE~
IF Decommissioning_cos1 = "Transportation & Disposal (conductor)"THEN Tran_disp_cond_prf ELSE~
Part_remvl_fac_input
