Chance Cost_uncertainty
Title: Cost uncertainty
Description: Probability distribution of the ratio of the actual to the estimated decommissioning costs. This is based on a study comparing actual with estimated decommissioning costs of platforms in the Gulf of Mexico with empirical data from approximately 40 projects involving 120 structures. It found that actual costs averaged 12% more than estimated costs, with a standard deviation of 23%.  We model this as a lognormal distribution assuming that bias and variability are proportional to the estimated cost.
Definition: Lognormal( 1.12, 1.23 )
NodeLocation: 272,352,1
NodeSize: 72,32
WindState: 2,795,464,634,381
ValueState: 2,532,240,729,345,1,CDFP
Aliases: FormNode Actual_estimated_co1
GraphSetup: {!40000|Att_contlinestyle Graph_pdf_valdim:1}

