Variable Input_decommiss__co1
Title: Input decommiss. costs by selectedscenario
Units: $
Description: Enables model operator to compare the complete platform removal costs to the partial platfor removal costs for each platform
Definition: (IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Mobilization & Demobilization' THEN  ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '1 Complete platform removal' THEN Worst_case_mob_demob ELSE  Worst_case_mob_demob ~
 ELSE IF  Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Permitting (NEPA/CEQA)' THEN Permit_Compli_cost~
 ELSE IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Shell Mound Removal ' THEN ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '1 Complete platform removal'  THEN Worst_case_shell_mou ELSE 0~
 ELSE IF Decommissioning_cos1 = 'Reef Enhancement' THEN ~
 IF Decommissioning_alt6 = '2 Partial platform removal'  THEN Worst_case_reef_cost ELSE 0~
ELSE Input_decommiss__cos)*Cost_uncertainty
